{"type": "text", "timestamp": 1791577706720, "sessionID": "ses_edda687beffeMlFAkUxQ1Ke9Y1", "part": {"id": "prt_1225a22e2001OS1bRBKw1AXOPC", "messageID": "msg_1225a1b18001H41AgIWFuZX9hQ", "sessionID": "ses_edda687beffeMlFAkUxQ1Ke9Y1", "type": "text", "text": "## Base stage complete\n\nAdmitted `DoubleQuota` first, then `CallerA` and `CallerB`, all at revision 1. Retrieved both closed caller definitions and validated both successfully.\n\n### Immutable definition pins\n\n| Definition | Pin |\n|---|---|\n| DoubleQuota | `082f586ab016e061f25a5c0d26f9636614ff2749570418a46e21062a958c33d0` |\n| CallerA | `a774dd52e445c0c5ef37448a23ce51e25fd4f06ac907f483587fc1232cfa5540` |\n| CallerB | `19a4324c4423e32295ac57bfd436c6f368b89538bec82b5819af3f46b2b26815` |\n\nBoth callers are pinned to that exact `DoubleQuota` identity. Retrieval reported no successors or migrations.\n\n### Validation\n\n| Caller | Status | Expanded VM nodes | Plan identity |\n|---|---|---:|---|\n| CallerA | valid | 8 | `51aff32fcd62a91b6cf9f218cf04b16b5d51fafd79baa3507154cbb477161fb7` |\n| CallerB | valid | 8 | `e41e0ce6cb6aaf69b914c813eef5235c0ff921281275d9cf12f735d10c732b21` |\n\n### Representative executions\n\nAll input and output bytes below are hexadecimal. Rejected execution results are preserved.\n\n| Caller | Input | Actual result |\n|---|---|---|\n| A | `0102` | Value **10**, UInt16BE `000a` |\n| A | `aaaa` | Value **516**, UInt16BE `0204` |\n| A | `abab` | `FIRST_CAP`, offset 0, at `g1` |\n| A | `aaab` | `SECOND_CAP`, offset 1, at `g2` |\n| A | `abab00` | `TRAILING`, offset 2, at `input_end` |\n| A | `01` | `TRUNCATED`, offset 1, at `read_y` |\n| B | `01` | Value **14**, UInt16BE `000e` |\n| B | `9f` | Value **488**, UInt16BE `01e8` |\n| B | `a0` | `SECOND_CAP`, offset 0, at `g2` |\n| B | `ab` | `FIRST_CAP`, offset 0, at `g1` |\n| B | `ab00` | `TRAILING`, offset 1, at `input_end` |\n| B | empty | `TRUNCATED`, offset 0, at `read_x` |\n\nThe executions confirm inclusive cap boundaries, `g1` preceding `g2` when both checks would fail, and end-of-input rejection before computation.\n\n**Stopped after the base stage. No successor or migration was created.**", "time": {"start": 1791577694946, "end": 1791577706717}, "metadata": {"openai": {"itemId": "msg_07f109bb36e40919016ac94e5fe0888199bf86865ce69bf388", "phase": "final_answer"}}}}
